{
  "id": "JHN.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 15",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu niye omutsabibu kwatoto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie nisie omutsabibu kwatoto, naye Papa niye omulimili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli lisaka mwisie eliraama ebiamo ta, aliyinaiho; ne buli lisaka eliamanga ebiamo, alikhalila, mbu limeete okhwama ebiamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano mumalile okhusiiyikha khulwa likhuwa elia emubooleele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menyenje mwisie, ninasie mwinywe. Shinga lisaka olwa liranyala okhwama ebiamo khubwalio, harali okhumenya khumutsabibu ta, nilwo olwa muranyala murio inywe harali okhumenya mwisie tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie nisie omutsabibu, neenyu muli amasaka. Oumenya mwisie, ninasi muye, omwenoyo yaamanga ebiamo ebinji; okhuba harali isie shimunyala okhukhola eshindu shiosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu naba naramenya mwisie ta, asukunwa shinga lisaka, naniala; abandu nibakakhung'aasia, nibakasukuna mumulilo, nikasambwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuba nimumenya mwisie, amakhuwa kanje nako nikamenya mwinywe, musabe liosi elia mwenya, nalio lilamukholelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwikhuwa lino Papa aheebungwa oluyali, mbu olwa mwamanga ebiamo ebinji; khandi murio mulaba abeechi banje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shinga Papa olwa yambeelile isie, siesi ndamuheelile inywe endio; menye mubuheeli bwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuba nimuhulilanga amalako kanje, mulamenyanga mubuheeli bwanje; sbinga isie olwa ndahuliilenje amalako kaPapa, nimenya mubuheelibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakhuwa kano emubooleele, mbu okhwikhoya khwanje khube mwinywe, khandi mbu okhwikhoya khweenywe khwitsule.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nilio lilako lianje, mbu muheelanenje, shinga isie olwa ndamuheelile inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulaho ouli nobuheeli obushila buno, mbu omundu okhuhaana obulamubwe khulwa abeetsabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe muli abeetsa banje nimuba nimukhola akeenako aka emulaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimulanga abasumba khandi tawe; okhuba omusumba shiamanyanga aka omwamiwe akhola ta; ne emulanjile inywe mbu abeetsa; okhuba kosi aka ndahuliile khuPapa ndamumanyiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe shimwayandobola isie ta, habula isie ndamulobola inywe, nimuraho, mbu mutsie mwame ebiamo, khandi mbu ebiamo bieenywe bimenye; mbu likhuwa liosi elia mulasaba Papa muliira lianje, amuheelesie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakhuwa kano emulaka, mbu mana muheelanenje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obukiyi bweshialo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshialo nishiba nishimukiya, mumanyile mbu siesi shiangiya khale, nishishili okhumukiya inywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwakhabeele abeshialo, khane eshialo shiakhaheelile abali abashione shichila shimuli abeshialo ta, habula ndamulobola mushialo, niko akachila eshialo nishimukiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yitsulile likhuwa elia ndamuboolela, mbu omusumba shiashila omwamiwe ta. Nibaba nibasandia isie, nineenywe balamusandia mwesi; nibaba nibahulila likhuwa lianje, balahulila nende akeenywe nako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne amakhuwa ako kosi balamukholela khulwa eliira lianje shichila shibamumanya oyo owanduma ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimba nindarakheetsile nisungana ninabo, khane shibakhabeele nobwonooni tawe; ne bulaano shibali nende eshia baboola khubwonooni bwabwe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oungiya isie amukiya nende Papa yesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimba nindakhakholile mubo emilimo echia oundi yesi arakhola ta, khane shibakhabeele nobwonooni tawe; ne bulaano baluutsi nibakiya isie khandi nende Papa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kano keekhola mbu likhuwa eliahandiikwa mumalako kabwe liusibwe, mbu Bangiya harali eshifune ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Omuhabini oyo alaba niyeetsile, owa ndalamurumila okhurula khuPapa, niye Roho wobwatoto, owitsa narula khuPapa, ye alandumbulila akobuloli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nineenywe mwesi murumbula akobuloli, shichila mwabeelenje ninasi halala okhurula khukhuchaaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.15.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
